  "content": "\"None of us ever wants to be in his shoes or go through what he is still living with, including the Ninth Circuit upholding his conviction last year,\" Gerchow says. \"I know Joe personally. He is brilliant. You don't become the first CISO at Facebook, Uber, and Cloudflare by accident. What I respect is that he did not disappear after the verdict. His case made me sharper about decision-making under pressure, about who gets looped in early, and about where the line sits between protecting the company and protecting yourself.\"",
